  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: af6c11f0d531f4249801ea5c2de41bcb, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ReadableTrigger
  interactionPrompt: Read
  backgroundImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5face2da520a6fa4fa8eff1c614aff70, type: 3}
  overrideBackgroundSize: 0
  backgroundSize: {x: 375, y: 500}
  fontOverride: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d8b60348e071a7047abbe1036bf5145d, type: 2}
  overrideAlignment: 0
  textAlignment: 257
  overrideMargins: 0
  textMargins: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  overrideLineSpacing: 0
  lineSpacing: 0
  overrideFontSize: 1
  fontSize: 18
  overrideFontColor: 1
  fontColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 1}
  pages:
  - "Excerpt from the Gravekeeper\u2019s Notes\nAdel family\n\n\nFamily members:\nJason
    Adel, 5, Deceased\nMaria Adel, 31, Alive\nMonroe Adel, 31, Deceased\n\nJason
    is interred within these grounds.\n\nCause of death: Suffocation\n\nTime of death:
    December 28th, 1998, Tuesday 8:04 PM"
  - "Jason and Monroe Adel were found dead at home after a struggle. Monroe had bled
    out from multiple stab wounds; Jason died of a neck injury that appeared to be
    his father\u2019s doing.\n\nMaria was committed to an asylum, later released,
    then banned for life after a psychotic attempt to break through the gates to
    reach the grave.\n\nMaria is not allowed entry under any circumstances."
