  - "Excerpt from the Gravekeeper\u2019s Notes\nAdams family\n\nFamily members:\nEdwin
    Adams, 21, Alive\nJane Adams, 54, Deceased\nRebecca Adams, 48, Alive\n\nJane
    Adams is interred within these grounds.\n\nCause of death: Suicide\n\nTime of
    death: December 22, 1985, Sunday 3:21 AM"
  - 'Jane Adams raised her son, Edwin, by strict routine. When he was seven, she
    sent him to family friends out of state, telling neighbors it was for better
    schooling.


    Weeks later, Jane took her own life. Edwin was never told of
    her death or called back. Whatever she had done, she would not answer for it
    openly; she died alone so her son would never learn the truth.'
  rightColumnPages: []
  overrideRightColumnMargin: 0
  rightColumnMargin: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  keeperRemarks:
  - Her son, Edwin, was never told how she died.
  redPenPhrases: []
  fieldNoteId: 
