  lineSpacing: 0
  overrideFontSize: 1
  fontSize: 18
  overrideFontColor: 1
  fontColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 1}
  pages:
  - "Excerpt from the Gravekeeper\u2019s Notes\nVanderbilt family\n\nFamily members:\nAaron
    Vanderbilt, 69, Deceased\nHarold Vanderbilt, 42, Unknown\nErick Vanderbilt, 22,
    Alive\n\nAaron Vanderbilt is interred within these grounds.\n\nCause of death:
    Gunshot wound\n\nTime of death: June 27, 1993, Sunday 7:48 PM"
  - 'Aaron Vanderbilt carried the weight of absence. His brother disappeared many
    years ago under circumstances no one could trace, leaving Aaron alone. Capable
    and clever, he still fell in with dangerous people whose loyalties never lasted,
    and his last years left him isolated and wary.


    Aaron Vanderbilt rests here
    alone.'
  rightColumnPages: []
  overrideRightColumnMargin: 0
  rightColumnMargin: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  keeperRemarks:
  - Harold, the younger brother, vanished years ago and was never traced.
  redPenPhrases:
  - His brother disappeared many years ago under circumstances no one could trace
  fieldNoteId: 
