--- !u!114 &1217414736
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1217414732}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: af6c11f0d531f4249801ea5c2de41bcb, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ReadableTrigger
  interactionPrompt: Read
  backgroundImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 1bbc76b0c4da7a148913c583214c3611, type: 3}
  overrideBackgroundSize: 1
  backgroundSize: {x: 1040, y: 693}
  fontOverride: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0a78256acac7a7b46bdb1b2a71386597, type: 2}
  overrideAlignment: 1
  textAlignment: 258
  overrideMargins: 1
  textMargins: {x: 160.68, y: 147.68, z: 563.64, w: 120.65}
  overrideLineSpacing: 1
  lineSpacing: 6
  overrideFontSize: 1
  fontSize: 20
  overrideFontColor: 1
  fontColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 1}
  pages:
  - '<size=145%><b>THE WATCHMAN''S NOTES</b></size>

    <size=85%>1999</size>


    <i>In
    this book you will find instructions on how to watch over this graveyard. Do
    not deviate from these instructions. This book contains a compilation of all
    recordings from previous grave watchers.</i>


    <i>This resting place is centuries
    old and should not be tampered with. As the gravekeeper, you will read the following
    instructions and abide by them.</i>'
  - "<align=center><font=\"LiberationSans SDF\"><size=115%>\u2022</size></font> 
    Ensure that the lights are on at all times throughout the graveyard.\n<font=\"LiberationSans
    SDF\"><size=115%>\u2022</size></font>  Ensure that the crucifix is properly affixed
    onto the door of the cabin at all times. The crucifix will determine your sanity.\n<font=\"LiberationSans
    SDF\"><size=115%>\u2022</size></font>  If you need a break, return to the cabin.
    It is always safe so long as the crucifix is on the door.</align>"
  rightColumnPages:
  - "<align=center><font=\"LiberationSans SDF\"><size=115%>\u2022</size></font> 
    You must only allow for visitors who are directly related to the deceased.\n<font=\"LiberationSans
    SDF\"><size=115%>\u2022</size></font>  Do not blindly trust visitors. Always
    cross reference any information they provide you.\n<font=\"LiberationSans SDF\"><size=115%>\u2022</size></font> 
    You will stand guard at the gate to prevent unwanted visitors from tampering
    with the gravesites. You must also patrol the grounds.\n<font=\"LiberationSans
    SDF\"><size=115%>\u2022</size></font>  If someone is trespassing, use your flashlight
    to deter them. Check near the gravesites for trespassers at all times.</align>\n\n<size=72%><i>(continued)</i></size>"
  - "<align=center><font=\"LiberationSans SDF\"><size=115%>\u2022</size></font> 
    Keep the back gate locked at all times. No entry is permitted through the back.\n<font=\"LiberationSans
    SDF\"><size=115%>\u2022</size></font>  The CCTV camera system monitors both entry
    gates. It is important to monitor them to keep the area secure. You can view
    them in the corner of the cabin.\n<font=\"LiberationSans SDF\"><size=115%>\u2022</size></font> 
    Most importantly: respect the burial sites. Do not disturb their rest; deter
    those who are unwelcomed.</align>\n\n<size=80%><i>\u2014 end \u2014</i></size>"
  overrideRightColumnMargin: 1
  rightColumnMargin: {x: 536.36, y: 147.68, z: 178.6, w: 120.65}
  keeperRemarks: []
  redPenPhrases:
  - You must only allow for visitors who are directly related to the deceased.
  - Always cross reference any information they provide you.
  fieldNoteId: 
  enableLowSanityOverride: 0
  lowSanityThreshold: 0.25
  lowSanityOverrides:
